# Wordle solver

- Toolchain is Rust 1.88+ via `rust-toolchain.toml`.
- Prefer headless `cargo run --release -- suggest --history …` unless a TTY is available.
- Validate with `make check` or `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, and `cargo test --release`.
- Use scoped `cargo test --release --lib <module>::` for small core changes.
- Never use debug `cargo test` for solver-heavy tests.
- Set `WORDLE_SOLVER_CACHE` in sandboxes so the pattern cache is writable and isolated.
- Do not run ignored full-answer benchmarks as the default validation loop.
